    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5229" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bessālis</span></b> , e, adj.
		bes, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>comprising eight</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laterculus,</span>”
				<i>a tile eight inches long</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					5, 10, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">7, 4, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scutula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					8, 71, 7</span></i>
			: clausulae, Porphyr. prooem. ad Hor. Epod.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b> for <i>any thing of
				small value</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">comula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 58, 5</span></i>
			.</div>
